# The minimal reproduction of the regression reported on ConcordLib/RimWorld#1, which the
# maintainer says is fixed in Concord 0.24.0 / adapter v1.6.6. A plain WSL run cannot confirm
# that: his bridge died reconciling a CONTESTED UIRoot.UIRootOnGUI, and an eight-mod game
# contests nothing. Two ingredients have to be put back.
#
#   Prepatcher  marks every other mod's assemblies reflection-only after a mod list change and
#               answers null to any dependency lookup into them.
#   RimThemes   declares [HarmonyPatch(typeof(UIRoot))] [HarmonyPatch("UIRootOnGUI")] - the exact
#               method Pickle takes. It is the only active mod that targets UIRoot itself; the
#               others go for the UIRoot_Entry / UIRoot_Play subclasses and contest nothing.
#
# first: for the two that have to be in place before anything loads. RimThemes stays late on
# purpose: the failure was late contention.
#
# packageId                         workshopId   what the run uses it for
first:concordlib.concord            3758333473   # the backend under test
